sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor C as Customer
  participant App as Business App
  participant API as Agent API
  participant LLM as Gemini (LLM)
  participant PE as Policy Engine
  participant BA as Business API (Orders)
  participant DB as Database
  App->>API: POST /api/v1/sessions (API key, customer id)
  API->>DB: store hashed session token
  API-->>App: session_token
  C->>App: "Please cancel order ORD-10023"
  App->>API: POST /api/v1/chat (API key, session, message)
  API->>API: verify session, injection screen, sentiment
  API->>LLM: conversation + tool list
  LLM-->>API: plan {intent: cancel_order, action: cancel_order(ORD-10023)}
  API->>PE: validate(action, params, session)
  PE->>DB: order exists & belongs to session customer? status?
  PE-->>API: needs_confirmation
  API->>DB: log action (awaiting_confirmation)
  API-->>App: "Please confirm: I will cancel ORD-10023…"
  C->>App: "YES"
  App->>API: POST /api/v1/chat
  API->>PE: re-validate pending action
  PE-->>API: still permitted
  API->>BA: cancel_order(ORD-10023)
  BA->>DB: update order status
  BA-->>API: {status: cancelled}
  API->>DB: log action (executed)
  API-->>App: "Done — order ORD-10023 has been cancelled"
